            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">作品名</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-lg">江戸城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">分類</p>
              <p class="mt-2">和風城郭</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">実制作期間</p>
              <p class="mt-2">11ヶ月</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">所在地</p>
              <p class="mt-2">
                〒100-0001 東京都千代田区千代田一丁目1番
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">築城年</p>
              <p class="mt-2">慶長年間～寛永年間</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">築城主</p>
              <p class="mt-2">徳川将軍家</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">形式</p>
              <p class="mt-2">城郭：平城　天守閣：独立式層塔型天守</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">制作ソフト</p>
              <p class="mt-2">Minecraft Java Edition v1.20~現在バージョン</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">作品区分</p>
              <p class="mt-2">和風建築復元</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#998d82]">制作状況</p>
              <p class="mt-2">拡張</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

    <!-- Gallery -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示写真
      </h2>

      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <img src="/images/edocastle.jpg" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle1.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle2.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle3.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle4.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle5.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle6.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle7.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle8.png" alt="">
        <img src="/images/edocastle9.png" alt="">

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Back -->

    <div class="mt-24">
<a
        href="/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
